                        "category":  "Ecology",
                        "summary":  "A glowing high-altitude bloom provides edible citrus nectar and powerful regenerative ingredients.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Pale purple flowers with golden veins float on nearly invisible roots. Brewed petals form a golden pain-soothing liquid, but overharvesting can collapse delicate floating ecosystems."
