                        "title":  "Everbloom Vine",
                        "category":  "Ecology",
                        "summary":  "A stable hybrid yields strong flexible structural vines and mild non-addictive healing flowers.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Gold-and-green-veined vines grow slowly into elegant patterns suited to rope and floating-structure reinforcement. The useful hybrid has few direct hazards but is vulnerable to pests that may spread into nearby crops."
